# GMS asks for a shield or a dagger scabbard in the off hand and grants DEF,
# avoidability, attack and damage reduction for it. Two of those four have
# nowhere to land: DEF here is a flat lever rather than a percentage, and
# nothing in the game avoids anything.
#
# What is left is on GMS's own figures -- 6% of the damage taken a level, and
# attack ending at its +20. Both wait on the off hand: nothing in the catalog
# fills the secondary slot yet, so this skill is learnable and grants nothing
# until secondaries are written. See Skill.requires_secondary.
name: "Shield Mastery"
skill_order: 8
description:
  "What you carry in your off hand turns blows aside. Decreases damage taken "
  "and increases Attack Power. Needs something in the secondary slot."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_BANDIT
max_level: 10
requires_secondary: true
base {
  damage_taken_pct: 0.06
  attack: 2
}
per_level {
  damage_taken_pct: 0.06
  attack: 2
}
